  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Laboremus Uganda Ltd - Emata Future of Farmer Financing - Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emata is an innovative financing solution that brings affordable loans to dairy farmers in Uganda using end-to-end digital processes, data-backed risk analytics and a mobile-based distribution model. Access to affordable credit will unlock employment opportunities, increase financial inclusion, strengthen the agricultural supply value chain  and trigger domestic investment within Uganda across other agricultural value chains in East Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
